OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain over
OL,6,FFife and Central to start will clear
OL,7,Fto the south. Dry with clear spells
OL,8,Ffurther north. Then dry overnight with
OL,9,Fclear spells leading to a cold, frosty
OL,10,Fnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA mostly dry day with patchy
OL,13,Fcloud and long sunny spells after a
OL,14,Ffrosty start. Perhaps cloudier in the
OL,15,Fnorth later with the odd shower
OL,16,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
