OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells Friday, the odd
OL,7,Fshower in the north possible. Dry with
OL,8,Fsome long sunny spells Saturday. Dry
OL,9,Fon Sunday. Cold with frosty nights.
